# 🎉 Eternity v0.7.4 Official Release!

Welcome to my personal website! This is the first official deployment with the main site's core features completed. Here's everything included in this release:

## 🌐 Website Architecture

- ✅ **Bilingual System**: Full Traditional Chinese / English support
- ✅ **Keystatic CMS Integration**: Visual content management system
- ✅ **Markdoc Content Format**: Structured document editing
- ✅ **Cloudflare Pages Deployment**: Global CDN acceleration
- ✅ **Responsive Design**: Desktop and mobile device support

## 📄 Page Features

- **Homepage**: Typewriter effects, dynamic background, hero section
- **About Me**: Bio, skills showcase (with interactive modals), work experience, certifications
- **Projects**: 16 technical projects with tag filtering, status badges, featured items
- **Links**: 11 social media and portfolio platform links, categorized
- **Updates**: Project progress and announcement system
- **Contact**: Contact form integrated with Resend email service
- **Console Easter Egg**: Interactive terminal simulator

## 🎨 Interactive Components

- **Global Music Player**: Background music playback (2 tracks)
- **Global Search**: Quick search for projects and content
- **Ripple Effect**: Click water ripple animations
- **Scroll to Top**: Smooth scroll navigation
- **Image Viewer**: Large image preview modal
- **Cookie Consent**: Privacy policy banner
- **Flip Cards**: 3D card flip animations

## 🧩 Sidebar Card System

6 configurable sidebar cards:

- **Quote Card**: Random inspirational quotes
- **Music Player Card**: Embedded music controller
- **Visitor Counter Card**: Cloudflare Workers integration
- **Latest Update Card**: Auto-display newest updates
- **Quick Stats Card**: Project and content statistics
- **Table of Contents Card**: Page navigation

## 📦 Project Content

16 technical projects included, covering:

- **AI & Machine Learning**: U.E.P Personal Virtual Desktop Assistant, Azure Face Recognition App
- **Web Applications**: GDG-Portal Community Platform, SparkBoard Serverless Collaboration, One Tea Green E-commerce
- **Game Development**: Digital Undercurrent Sokoban, Poole Town Text RPG, LBN System Simulation
- **Utility Tools**: Ranza Universal Randomizer, Wyrm Database Query, Omniimagainer Image Processing, StegoApollo Steganography
- **Automation Systems**: School Info Push System, End-to-end LAN Control
- **Discord Bot**: U.E.P's Mind

## 🔗 External Links

Integrated personal platforms:

- **Dev Platforms**: GitHub, Work Resume
- **Social Media**: Twitter, Facebook, YouTube
- **Creative Platforms**: BandLab (Music), pixiv (Art), Novel Platform, Steam
- **Project Docs**: U.E.P's Imaginary Space, Mission Squad Studio

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frameworks**: Astro 5 + React 19
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
- **Content Management**: Keystatic CMS + Markdoc
- **Type Safety**: TypeScript
- **Deployment**: Cloudflare Pages + Workers
- **Toolchain**: pnpm + Turbo + ESLint + Prettier

## 📝 Content Management

- **Bilingual Content**: All pages and projects support zh-tw/en
- **Markdoc Editing**: Rich text format with custom components
- **Image Optimization**: Auto compression and format conversion
- **Version Control**: Git-managed, branching strategy (develop → staging → main)

## 🚧 Next Steps

- **Docs Site Development**: Migrate U.E.P's Imaginary Space to apps/uep
- **Feature Enhancement**: Visitor guestbook, RSS subscription
- **Performance Optimization**: Image lazy loading, code splitting
- **SEO Enhancement**: Structured data, sitemap generation

---

Thank you for visiting! This website will be continuously updated, stay tuned for more content 🚀
